      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "They should just separate Dynamic mode and Forced mode.  Everyone keeps blaming forced mode issues on dynamic mode and using it as excuse to discourage people from using dynamic mode EVEN THOUGH they literally designed dynamic mode to minimize issues caused by it (which were very rare to begin with and all solvable by world devs).  The dishonesty of this has grown very tiresome.\nmade a canny for it. https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/separate-near-clip-forced-mode-and-dynamic-mode",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
