      "value": "@{5f2d19d0a2990547bfc05f3a|full_name}: The issues of dynamic mode are extremely rare.  I've only seen a couple worlds have any noticeable skybox issues, and that's including back in context of the mod forcing it to always be 0.01 in every world.  It's impact is dramatically overstated, and also very easily fixed by the world creator (tested and proven).  ps: i world hop a lot so i see many many worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
