      "value": "@{5f2e2ab863aa6f7311d53d03|full_name}: If they are going that route, they should change the options to Dynamic, Dynamic (override world), and rename forced to Extreme Mode or something.  And again, make them accessible.\nDynamic Mode cannot break any world in a way that isn't easily fixed by the creator (allowing them to force dynamic off is completely unnecessary tbh).  Only forced mode (0.001 nearclip) can cause unsolvable graphical bugs.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
