      "value": "@{5a766b8a0868b44b53569ce4|full_name}: You wouldn't be overriding anything the world creator has set. Just like you can't jump in a world with jump disabled. The toggles that were teased are a way of forcing some things or instance creators to turn certain features on or off as well.\nThe idea here is world creators need to understand how the camera works, and if they choose to force a specific viewing frustum they can do so.\nI'm all for dynamic being on by default, that's what I use to not break the world I'm in while retaining the view I want in VR.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
