      "value": "@{5a766b8a0868b44b53569ce4|full_name}: As a developer you very much need control over the camera in many scenarios, from framing all the way to optimisation.\nWith the system teased, if it ever gets into any form of development (because I don't know what stage it is in), then I believe the players will need to be notified of what is enabled or disabled when they load into the world.\nIt's not as if you would not know your settings is being forced off, and you can leave. If suddenly every world creator is forcing it off then something else is wrong entirely.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
