      "value": "@{5a766b8a0868b44b53569ce4|full_name}: I was thinking more for those using forced mode, I always normally use dynamic myself.\nIt's worth noting that forced can cause more than just skybox/fog issues, I recall back in the modded days someone encountered a world where the lighting was broken with the near clip plane mod active, although an exceedingly rare issue I believe.\nIt does however serve as another reason to move it back to the quick menu, beyond just quick access.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
