      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5f2d19d0a2990547bfc05f3a|full_name}: Yeah i've seen plenty of lighting/shadow issues, as well as floating point exacerbating as pointed out here, caused by forced mode or setting clip to 0.001 with mods: \nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/1220-near-clip-forced-mode-exacerbates-floating-point-errors-on-mouse-cursor-far\nI'm well aware of the issues it can cause.  Hence they should be separated as settings, because they are completely different animals.  If dynamic mode is causing these issues, it is folly on the part of the world creator as they set things up in a delicate or incorrect way.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
